    "implementation_delta": "Publish DatasetsCleanPackage@1. The Datasets core remains dependency-free (empty install_requires). Sibling ipfs_kit_py / ipfs_accelerate_py gitlinks are excluded from package discovery and pruned from the sdist. Python classifiers now agree with requires-python >=3.12. Isolated overlay import and a hermetic python -m build wheel+sdist plus pip --no-deps --no-index --target install were observed without sibling trees, sys.path injection, import-time network, or mutable Git-branch release requires. Built artifacts stay in a private temp directory and are not a published PCPR release. Live solvers remain typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
